    "name": "Task Tracker API",
    "description": "Unified Team Task & Support Ticket Tracker. Run a \"Login ...\" request first: it stores the token, and every other request uses it.\n\nSeeded users all use the password Password@123.\n\nId variables (projectId, memberId, userId, workItemId) are filled in by the list/create requests.",
